OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FWatch: Sharif Ahmadzai, 26, leaves for
OL,7,Fa court appearance in Athens,
OL,8,Falongside a number of police officers
OL,10,FA man accused of murdering a Scottish
OL,11,Fwoman and disposing of her body in a
OL,12,Fsuitcase has appeared in court in
OL,13,FAthens.
OL,15,FThe body of 38-year-old Elisabeth-Jane
OL,16,FRoss was found inside a suitcase in an
OL,17,Fabandoned building on July 18.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
