OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785946757
OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FSharif Ahmadzai, a 26-year-old Afghan
OL,7,Frefugee who has been living lawfully
OL,8,Fin Greece for a decade, arrived at
OL,9,Fcourt in an unmarked grey Hyundai i30
OL,10,Fcar on Wednesday morning, alongside
OL,11,Fseveral police officers.
OL,13,FDuring the hearing, which lasted less
OL,14,Fthan two hours, Ahmadzai stated he did
OL,15,Fnot kill Ms Ross.
OL,17,FIt is understood he was assigned a
OL,18,Fcourt-appointed lawyer. He is expected
OL,19,Fto appear again for a further hearing
OL,20,Fon Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
