FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785946757
OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FGreek police previously said Ahmadzai
OL,7,Fadmitted to moving Ms Ross' body, but
OL,8,Fdenied the murder allegations.
OL,10,FHe has also been charged with robbery
OL,11,Fand violation of weapon laws.
OL,13,FMs Ross is believed to have died
OL,14,Fbetween five and seven days before she
OL,15,Fwas found. Police have not confirmed
OL,16,Fher cause of death.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
