OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FCCTV footage, released by Greek media
OL,7,Fand confirmed to ITV News by police,
OL,8,Fshows a man wheeling a suitcase down a
OL,9,Fstreet in Athens on July 16, near
OL,10,Fwhere Ms Ross' body was found two days
OL,11,Flater.
OL,13,FThe same man appears to leave the area
OL,14,Fwithout a suitcase or blue bag 13
OL,15,Fminutes later.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
