OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FOn the same night, police said
OL,7,FAhmadzai's wife allegedly woke up to
OL,8,Ffind her husband was not at home. She
OL,9,Falleged that when she checked his
OL,10,Flocation, he was at the apartment
OL,11,Fwhere Ms Ross had been staying.
OL,13,FPolice allege Ahmadzai withdrew money
OL,14,Ffrom Ms Ross' bank following her death
OL,15,Fand used her phone to send messages
OL,16,Fpretending to be her.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
