OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785946757
OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FMs Ross arrived in Greece on June 26
OL,7,Fand was working with the NGO Love
OL,8,FEvery Nation in Athens, which was co-
OL,9,Ffounded by Ahmadzai and his American
OL,10,Fwife, Alaina Hall.
OL,12,FAccording to the NGO's website, which
OL,13,Fhas since been taken offline, Hall and
OL,14,FAhmadzai met volunteering at a migrant
OL,15,Fcamp in Lesvos in 2016, where he was
OL,16,Fworking as a translator.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
