PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785946757
OL,3,CMan suspected of murdering Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman appears in Athens court
OL,6,FTheir NGO is described as a religious
OL,7,Forganisation which provides
OL,8,Fnecessities to families and
OL,9,Findividuals in Athens, including food,
OL,10,Fmedicine and temporary housing.
OL,11,FAhmadzai converted to Christianity in
OL,12,F2017, according to the website.
OL,14,FAhmadzai was born in Afghanistan and
OL,15,Farrived in Greece in 2016, according
OL,16,Fto the Love Every Nation website.
OL,18,FAfter his family was killed by the
OL,19,FTaliban, he decided to leave the
OL,20,Fcountry.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
